rrounding waterfront environment.</li><li>Private Outdoor Jacuzzis<br>Selected residences include private jacuzzis and plunge pools overlooking serene island surroundings and sea views.</li><li>Hotel-Inspired Lifestyle Services<br>The project delivers hospitality-driven living with premium amenities inspired by luxury beachfront resorts.</li><li>Prime Dubai Islands Positioning<br>Located beside beaches, promenades, hotels, and retail destinations with smooth city accessibility</li><li>Exclusive Low-Density Development<br>Limited inventory of residences enhances privacy, exclusivity, and long-term investment desirability.</li><li>Semi-Furnished Contemporary Interiors<br>Homes feature warm mood boards, European appliances, premium flooring, and refined modern detailing.</li><li>Strong Waterfront Investment Potential<br>Dubai Islands continues emerging as one of Dubai’s most promising luxury coastal investment destinations.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2185,"cta":{"id":3019,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/location_b535acdff5.jpg","hash":"location_b535acdff5","name":"location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Dubai Islands Dubai’s Emerging Waterfront Lifestyle Hub","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Marea Dubai Islands is strategically positioned within Dubai Islands A, a fast-rising waterfront destination redefining luxury coastal living in Dubai. Surrounded by beaches, marinas, resorts, and promenades, the community blends resort-style tranquility with urban convenience. Residents benefit from direct connectivity to Al Khaleej Road, Sheikh Zayed Road, and key city districts including Downtown Dubai, DIFC, and Dubai International Airport. The area is designed around leisure, wellness, and hospital